 of the classic Minesweeper puzzle game played on the surface of a cube.** \n\nBut watch your fingers. Every mistake triggers an explosion and costs you a try. With limited tries, every decision matters.\n\nThis is an early demo version. We're expanding it into a full game with more customisation options, new interactions, additional game modes, and deeper gameplay systems.\n\n**Subscribe for the full Minesweeper experience to be released in June.**\n\nYour feedback is incredibly valuable. If you enjoy the concept or have ideas for features, mechanics, or improvements, please leave a review and share your thoughts \u2014 your input will help shape the future full version of the game.", "short_description": "Minesweeper Demo is a VR version of the classic minesweeper puzzle game played on the surface of a cube. \n\nBut watch your fingers. Every mistake triggers an explosion and costs you a try. \n\n-\nThis is an early demo version. Subscribe for the full Minesweeper experience to be released in June.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://doncarrot.com/legal/minesweeper-demo", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Don Carrot", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://doncarrot.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26211018811902747"}, "review_message