keywords": ["puzzle", "minesweeper", "3d", "Demo", "game"], "long_description": "Minesweeper Demo is a VR version of the classic Minesweeper puzzle game played on the surface of a cube. Reveal safe tiles, flag hidden mines, and solve the logic puzzle using hand interactions while rotating the cube to inspect every side.\n\nRotate the cube, analyze the numbers, and clear every safe tile to win.\n\nBut watch your fingers. Every mistake triggers an explosion and costs you a try. With limited tries, every decision matters.\n\nThis demo showcases a new way to experience Minesweeper in virtual reality and passthrough, combining spatial reasoning, puzzle solving, and tactile interaction.\n\nThis is an early demo version. The goal is to expand it into a full game with more customization options, new interactions, additional game modes, and deeper gameplay systems.\n\nYour feedback is incredibly valuable. If you enjoy the concept or have ideas for features, mechanics, or improvements, please leave a review and share your thoughts \u2014 your input will help shape the future full version of the game.", "short_description": "Minesweeper Demo is a VR version of the classic Minesweeper puzzle game played on the surface of a cube. Reveal safe tiles, flag hidden mines, and solve the logic puzzle using hand interactions while rotating the cube to inspect every side.\n\nBut watch your fingers. Every mistake triggers an explosion and costs you a try. With limited tries, every decision matters.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://doncarrot.com/legal/minesweeper-demo", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Don Carrot", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://doncarrot.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_su